source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: A missing preceding space blocks the substitution, so Jira leaves the hyphens alone.
-- input.jira --
{{a-- b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a-- b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a-- b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
